WEBVTT

00:16:27.761 --> 00:16:30.803
PM: In vsi se moramo več nagibati naprej.

00:16:30.803 --> 00:16:32.134
SS: Veliko nagibanja naprej.

00:16:32.134 --> 00:16:33.134
PM: Hvala ti, Sheryl.

00:16:33.134 --> 00:16:35.178
Hvala, da si se nagnila naprej
in rekla ja.

00:16:35.178 --> 00:16:36.630
SS: Hvala.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.899
(Aplavz)